# In-game pause menu without save/load (multiplayer): a 480 x 314 dialog centred on a 40% scrim with the commands as a
# column of menu buttons, in the original order; no art, like QuitMenu. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080.
scrim
window $QuitMenuParent centre middle 0 0 480 314 dialog
hide $WinLogo
stack centre top 0 415 440 14
  item $ButtonOptions 52 menu
  item $ButtonRestart 52 menu
  item $ButtonExit 52 menu
  item $ButtonReturn 52 menu
end
